+# EXEC0160 — Enhanced-only Winter labor, not original stock NES gameplay
+
+Continues EXACT EXEC0159 C11 application and all prior assets. Original 14/27-country setup and authentic first playable Spring are UNFINISHED. Adds fourth sequential Enhanced research season with verified original stock Spring source checkpoint, 3 labor commands, controller-only input, source-bound 160-byte GW20 exclusive save/cold-load. Winter cold/food/tax/merchant/AI/dynasty not modeled, Classic remains locked, no next-year seasonal advance. Original ROM and private Mesen evidence are never in public release.
+
+### Tested states
+`VERIFIED_STATIC`: source and tests. `OBSERVED_RUNTIME_STOCK`: inherited archived and fresh checkpoint evidence only. `TESTED_PORT_LINUX`: CMake/CTest and smoke after execution. `NOT RUN`: original new Mesen, Win32/NSIS, physical Xbox, campaigns.
